<title>USA: Franklin Cty USD 290, Kan., won by Chiles Heider.</title>
<headline>Franklin Cty USD 290, Kan., won by Chiles Heider.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chiles Heider Division of Smith Barney Inc said it won $2 million of Franklin County Unified School District No. 290 (Ottawa), Kan., general obligation school building bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.315 percent.</p>
</text>
